     However, a caveat when sacrificing to change the alignment of an
altar. Remember that your luck decreases when you fail so if you call on
your god there's a good chance he will be angry. It's thus a good idea
to be aware of your food supply and don't risk eating any old meat in
the event it has become tainted. This problem is most evident when
finding an altar on the first few levels.

